# Where the dashboard and the files.gg viewer call the API (milestone-6 §13.1). Unset, it's
# same-origin `/api` (the Worker's files.gg/api/* passthrough), which sends the session
# cookie. In `npm run dev`, unset also mounts the in-memory mock API (mock-api.ts) at /api.
# Set it only for unusual local setups, such as a real API on another port:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Custom-domain viewers always call https://api.files.gg (from the Worker's #host-data).

# Public Turnstile site key (contract §8). Required for production builds.
# Dev and tests default to Cloudflare's always-pass testing key 1x00000000000000000000AA.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
